<title>USA: Meredith Corp Q3 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Meredith Corp Q3 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.33		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			 18,428		   13,789</p>
<p> Revs		     223,035		  219,418</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  55,594		   56,660</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.36		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net		 75,658		   38,659</p>
<p> Revs		631,987		  642,099</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  55,605		   56,461</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 9-mos earnings includes post-tax gain on discontinued operations of $27.7 million, or $0.50/shr, from sale of remaining cable television interests.</p>
<p>1996 9-mos earnings include $3.4 million, or $0.06/shr, gain on post-tax income from sale of book clubs.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
